        "body": "### What should we add?\r\n\r\nThis is not the correct usage of the term, addresses, as used by PySCF. Let's give these functions better names (strings or CI strings maybe?)\r\n\r\nAfter merging #23 , there may just be one function left, [fermion.bitstring_matrix_to_sorted_addresses](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd/stubs/qiskit_addon_sqd.fermion.bitstring_matrix_to_sorted_addresses.html#qiskit_addon_sqd.fermion.bitstring_matrix_to_sorted_addresses).",
